# Razor Columbina Fischl Bennett. ~20s Rot. Overvape Razor using C6 Bennett infusion. Lunarcharge is but a footnote, despite the strong Hydro/Electro uptime. Many close Sands and Goblet options, see comments. Fischl Q/E in Bennett Q. Self-Overloads not implemented.

# Team - Options listsed by DPS
razor char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
razor add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
razor add set="risingwinds" count=4;
razor add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 electro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
